  "chart": {
    "$description": "Categorical palette. Categories carry a stable color_token (cat-1…cat-12) so a category is the same colour on every chart. Every cat-* is ≥3:1 on bg and surface, and ≥15 ΔE2000 from every other cat-* in the same theme (test/contrast.test.mjs).",
